<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Rangi Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant Richard Cox</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Barʉ́wa ya kavɨrɨ ya Paúli kwa Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Barʉ́wa ya kavɨrɨ ya Paúli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="imt">Mʉlongooryo</para>
  <para style="ip">Barʉ́wa ɨhɨ yaandɨkwa nɨ Paúli mutumwi wa Yéesu Kirisitʉ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>). Barʉ́wa ɨhɨ Paúli amwaandɨkɨra Timotéeo. Ʉhʉ Timotéeo nɨ mwaambiriryi waachwe wa heehi ajáa na Paúli amʉlaangáa nɨ ja mwaana waachwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:2-5">1:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:1">2:1</ref></char>). Paúli aandɨka barʉ́wa ɨhɨ kati ˆajáa achuungwa ʉko múujii wa Róoma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:16-17">1:16-17</ref></char>). Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Néero noo ˆajáa mʉtemi wa Rúumi. Yeeye avaturikiryáa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ Vakirisitʉ sa vamuruma Yéesu na Paúli iiseáa kʉʉlawa arɨ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-8">4:6-8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Timotéeo ahokera barʉ́wa ɨhɨ mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa múuji wa Eféeso, ˆʉrɨ ɨsɨ ya Ásia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:18">1:18</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12-13">4:12-13</ref></char>). Na ˆvyeene yoónekanaa, barʉ́wa ɨhɨ yaandɨkwa kati ya myaaka ya 64-67 keende Kirisitʉ ˆavyaalwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">ˆCheene chabweeyya Paúli amwaandɨkɨre Timotéeo barʉ́wa ɨhɨ, nɨ kʉmʉheera Timotéeo mʉtɨma sa atuube kʉvariyʉla Masáare Maaja ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, na afafe kuyimirirya uturikiri woosi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:6-8">1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:3-10">2:3-10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:2-5">4:2-5</ref></char>). Paúli ajáa amʉlairirya Timotéeo avawyɨɨre vaantʉ ˆvamuruma Yéesu va ʉko Eféeso vareke kwiiruta ndihi sa masáare sɨ ˆyatéire (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:14">2:14</ref></char>). Vareke ʉvɨ woosi sa vave saama ja nyemi, ˆviimiwa neeja kʉtʉmama kɨra mʉrɨmo mʉʉja kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:21">2:21</ref></char>). Kɨɨntʉ chɨɨngɨ Paúli ˆamuwyɨɨra Timotéeo, nɨ asiite na ngururu joosi ʉvariyuli wa ʉloongo, maa kaa, ɨndoovariyʉla masáare ya kɨkomi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:13">1:13</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:2-5">4:2-5</ref></char>). Alʉʉsa Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho nɨ ja nkeeho ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, nɨ ukiindya ˆwabooha ˆʉvabwéeyyaa vaantʉ vakiimane na vadahe tʉmama kɨra mʉrɨmo mʉʉja (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:16-17">3:16-17</ref></char>). Kei, Paúli ajáa atɨɨte mpɨɨma nkʉʉlʉ yo moona Timotéeo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-4">1:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:9">4:9</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:21">21</ref></char>), noo ˆchooreka amʉloomba Timotéeo atamanye chaangʉ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:13">4:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">ˆVyeene Kɨtáabu ɨkɨ ˆChagavwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Lʉmbɨ ya Paúli kwa Timotéeo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paúli yoomʉheera mʉtɨma Timotéeo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3–2:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ʉlairiri kwa vatʉmami vaaja <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uturikiri wa sikʉ jo herererya <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 3:1-9">3:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ʉlairiri kwa Timotéeo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 3:10-4:5">3:10–4:5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masáare yo kiimikirirya na mwiikalo wa Paúli <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-22">4:6-22</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Lʉmbɨ ya Paúli kwa Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Paúli, nɨɨnɨ ˆnaanɨrɨrwa nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ kwa kʉsaaka kwaachwe nɨve <char style="w" lemma="Vatumwi">mutumwi</char> wa <char style="w">Kirisitʉ</char> <char style="w">Yéesu</char>, sa nvariyʉrɨre vaantʉ kwiichuunga kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ kwa nkaasʉ ˆɨrɨ kʉrɨ kʉkʉndɨkaniwa na Kirisitʉ Yéesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Nɨ kwaandɨkɨra niise weewe Timotéeo mwaana waanɨ. Nɨɨnɨ nakweenda maatʉkʉ vii. Nduwo, riiso ra wʉʉja na mwiikalo mʉʉja fuma kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ Taáta na kwa Kirisitʉ Yéesu, Mweenevyoosi wiitʉ, jive na weewe.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paúli Yoomʉdʉʉmba no Mʉheera Mʉtɨma Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Noomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆnɨmʉtʉ́mamɨraa na mʉtɨma sɨ ˆwaantwáalaa na kɨloongii, ja ˆvyeene vala baaba wiitʉ vamʉtʉmamɨráa. Kɨra uchikʉ na muusi nakʉkʉ́mbʉkɨraa na namʉlóombaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa weewe. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Nakʉ́mbʉkɨraa miísoori yaako mpɨɨndɨ ˆnasuukyáa. Na natɨɨte mpɨɨma maatʉkʉ vii yo koona, sa mbe na cheerʉ. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Nakʉ́mbʉkɨraa ˆvyeene umuruma Mʉlʉʉngʉ kɨkomi. Baa kei nakʉkʉ́mbʉkɨraa kʉra kuruma ˆkweene arɨ noko ta maáma waanyu Loíisi na íyo waanyu Yuníike. Kɨkomi, nɨɨnɨ namányire baa weewe ʉtɨɨte kuruma ˆkʉrɨ jeyyo.<verse eid="2TI 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Sa jeyyo, nɨ kukumbusikya niise, ʉjɨmbʉle wʉʉya wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ʉra ˆʉheewa sikʉ ˆnɨkʉvɨ́kɨɨre mɨkono yaanɨ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="1TI 4:14">1 Timotéeo 4:14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Bweeyya jei, sa Mʉlʉʉngʉ sɨ atʉheera <char style="w" lemma="Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja">Mʉtɨma</char> wa woowa tʉkʉ, maa kaa, atʉheera Mʉtɨma wa ngururu, wo kiiyenda na wo kiiyɨmɨrɨra.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Sa jeyyo, karɨ woónaa soni yo lʉʉsa masáare ya Mweenevyoosi wiitʉ tʉkʉ, baa karɨ woónaa soni sa nɨɨnɨ nachuungwa mʉnyololwii sa Kirisitʉ tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, uyimirirye hamwɨ na nɨɨnɨ uturikiri ˆwʉʉ́jaa ko variyʉla <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> kwa ngururu ˆʉheewa nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Mʉlʉʉngʉ noo atʉlamurirya na atʉkemera na lʉkemerwii lʉʉja, sɨ sa kʉbweeyya wʉʉja tʉkʉ, aka tʉkʉ, nɨ sa kweenda kwaachwe na sa nduwo jaachwe. Atʉheera nduwo ɨyo kwa njɨra ya Kirisitʉ Yéesu mpɨɨndɨ baa weerʉ ˆajáa akaarɨ sɨ anɨɨyʉmba. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Haaha Mʉlʉʉngʉ atʉváriyʉrɨɨre nduwo yaachwe kwa njɨra ya kʉʉja kwaachwe Kirisitʉ Yéesu. Yeeye atʉlamurirya, kei adʉmʉladʉmʉla inkwya na oonekya nkaasʉ na kʉdɨɨra kukwya kwa njɨra ya Masáare Maaja.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Mʉlʉʉngʉ aansaawʉla nɨɨnɨ nɨve mweeneri wa Masáare Maaja, mutumwi na mukiindya wa aya Masáare Maaja. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Ɨkɨ noo ˆchooreka nɨɨnɨ nootʉrɨkɨra jei aha mʉnyololwii. Baa jeyyo, sɨ nookoona soni tʉkʉ, sa namʉmányire yeeye ˆmweene namuruma na kɨkomi yeeye chɨɨmɨrɨra arɨ kɨra ˆnakɨvɨɨka kwaachwe fʉʉrʉ sikʉ ɨra ˆarɨ kʉʉja.<verse eid="2TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Kwaata kɨkomi ʉvariyuli ˆwateera fuma kwaanɨ. Bweeyya jeyyo ko ruma no keenda Kirisitʉ Yéesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Masáare Maaja ˆmeene ʉheewa nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ, yɨɨmɨrɨre kwa njɨra ya Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja, ʉhʉ ˆiíkalaa kʉrɨ suusu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Ʉmányire vaantʉ voosi va Ásia vaanvalandʉka na vamwɨ vaavo nɨ Fugéelo na Herimogéene.<verse eid="2TI 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Mweenevyoosi avalaange na riiso ra wʉʉja mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ vaantʉ va kaaya ya Onesifóoro, sa aanjeryáa mʉtɨma. Kei sɨ oonɨwáa soni kʉnʉ nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ mʉnyololwii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Yeeye ˆakafike vii Róoma, amanyɨka maatʉkʉ vii kʉʉnsaakɨra mpaka akaanshaana. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Nooloomba Mweenevyoosi Yéesu avalaange na riiso ra wʉʉja sikʉ ɨra ya ʉlamu! Baa weewe ʉmányire maaja ˆmeene aanyambirirya kʉra múujii wa Eféeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mulwi Nkoondo wa Kirisitʉ Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Haaha mwaana waanɨ, ʉve nkabaako kwa nduwo ˆɨrɨ kwa <char style="w">Kirisitʉ</char> <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Weewe ʉyateera masáare ˆmeene navariyʉláa mbere ja vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo. Masáare ayo ʉvakwaatye vaantʉ valʉme vara ˆuviiláangyaa, ˆveene varɨ daha vavariyʉrɨra vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Yimirirya hamwɨ na suusu uturikiri ja mulwi nkoondo mʉʉja wa Kirisitʉ Yéesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Kusiina mulwi nkoondo yoyoosi mpɨɨndɨ ˆarɨ nkoondwii ˆatʉ́mamaa mɨrɨmo yɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ, sa mpɨɨma yaachwe nɨ kʉsaaka kʉmweerya mʉtɨma ʉra ˆamwaandɨka ave mulwi nkoondo. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Kei, kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆasíindaa kwiichia akaheewa kʉnáálo koonɨ sɨ atúubire miiro yo kiichia tʉkʉ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Nɨ jeyyo viri, murimi ʉra ˆafafa tʉmama, asaakwa ahokere viintʉ vya ncholo vira ˆvichwíirwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Yakwaatyekwaatye aya ˆmeene nookuwyɨɨra, sa Mweenevyoosi kʉheera arɨ ʉkoonko wa masáare ayo yoosi.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Ʉndoomʉkʉmbʉkɨra Yéesu Kirisitʉ. Yeeye afʉfʉka na nɨ wa mbyaala ya mʉtemi <char style="w">Daúdi</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Samwéeli 7:12-13</ref>.</char></note> Ayo noo <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> ˆmeene naváriyʉlaa, <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>na kwa ayo mwaarɨ nooturikiriwa na nachuungwa ja nabweeyya ʉvɨ. Maa kaa, isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ sɨ richúungwaa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Na sa jeyyo, nayímiriryaa kɨra kɨɨntʉ sa vaantʉ ˆvasaawʉlwa nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Nabwéeyyaa jeyyo, sa vapate ʉra ʉlamuriri wa Kirisitʉ Yéesu, hamwɨ na nkongojima ya sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero.<verse eid="2TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Mpɨ́rɨ ɨhɨ nɨ yo kiilaangya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Koonɨ taakwya ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">kwiikala tʉrɨ ne.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Koonɨ tooyimirirya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">temerera tʉrɨ hamwɨ ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Koonɨ taséire sɨ tamʉmányire tʉkʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ne sea arɨ sɨ atʉmányire tʉkʉ.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Koonɨ tarékire kumwiilaangya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">yeeye chaala arɨ wo kiilaangiwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Yeeye sɨ arɨ daha kwiisiita tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉtʉmami ˆArumwa nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Karɨ ʉrékaa vaantʉ varimirye aya masáare tʉkʉ. Ʉvalʉme kutu mbere ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ karɨ viirútaa ndihi sa viintʉ sɨ ˆvitéire tʉkʉ. Viintʉ ivyo vyavasáambʉlaa vara ˆvavitéereraa. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Tʉmama na ngururu sa Mʉlʉʉngʉ akurume ʉrɨ mʉtʉmami sɨ ˆakwáatwaa nɨ soni, kʉnʉ wootaanga no variyʉla kɨkomi isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ ra kɨmáárɨ.<verse eid="2TI 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Ikerye fuma ndʉʉsɨka ja kɨhoho sɨ ˆjiréetaa nyemi kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Masáare ayo, yavabwéeyyaa vaantʉ vatuube rɨmɨrɨrarɨmɨrɨɨra mwiikalwii sɨ ˆutúubaa kɨra Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆasáakaa. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Ʉvariyuli ˆʉrɨ jei, weéneraa ja kɨloonda cha bekene muvirii. Vamwɨ va vaantʉ ava, nɨ vala Himenáayo na Filéeto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Ava vareka njɨra ya kɨmáárɨ na vaséaa kʉfʉfʉka kwahʉmʉla looka. Sa jeyyo, vasáambʉlaa kuruma kwa vaantʉ vamwɨ. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Maa kaa, mwaariryo ˆmweene Mʉlʉʉngʉ avɨɨka wɨɨma neeja na ˆwafafa, wachuungwa na mʉtooso waachwe walʉʉsa jei, “<char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> amányire ˆvarɨ vaachwe,”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19a </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="NUM 16:5">Ʉvalo 16:5</ref>.</char></note> kei walʉʉsa, “Kɨra ˆarɨ lʉʉsa irina ra <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char>, areke kʉsova ʉwoloki kwaachwe.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19b </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isáaya 28:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Nyuumba nkʉʉlʉ sɨ ivíjaa na saama ja saháabu na mpía vii tʉkʉ, maa kaa, yavíjaa na saama ja mɨtɨ na ja iroongo. Saama jimwi jatʉ́mamaa sikʉ ja ngovi vii na jimwi kɨra siikʉ. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Haaha koonɨ mʉʉntʉ iijɨ́rwɨɨre na iirékire na ayo mavɨ, kʉva arɨ saama ya kɨkomi, njija sa Mweeneevyo yeemweene, iimiwa neeja sa kɨra mʉrɨmo mʉʉja.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Ikerye fuma mpɨɨma mbɨ ja ʉtavana. Kei ʉmanyɨke kutuuba ʉwoloki, kuruma, kwiiyenda na mwiikalo mʉʉja hamwɨ na vaantʉ ˆvamwaánɨrɨraa Yéesu Mweenevyoosi na mɨtɨma myeerʉ. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Siita kwiiruta ndihi kwa kɨhoho na kwa kɨkoókoyo, sa ʉmányire masáare aya yaréetaa nkoondo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Mʉtʉmami wa Mweenevyoosi sɨ asaakwa ave mʉʉntʉ wa nkoondo tʉkʉ, kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, asaakwa ave ˆahola kwa kɨra mʉʉntʉ, ˆamányire variyʉla masáare neeja na muyimiriryi. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Kei asaakwa ɨndoovakaanʼya mpoolɨ vaantʉ vara ˆvamʉkɨ́ɨkanaa. Ifaanaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ akavabweeyya <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">vavalandʉke</char> fuma uvii waavo na vataange kɨmáárɨ. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Aho, mɨryʉʉngʉ yaavo vahɨndʉkɨra ɨrɨ na neha varɨ mɨteo ya Ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ ra <char style="w">Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ</char>, ˆreene ravakwaata vatʉmame kɨɨntʉ rooro ˆrasáakaa.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ʉvɨ wa Sikʉ ja Ʉhero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Maa kaa, taanga sikʉ ja ʉhero kʉva jiri ˆjafafa maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Vaantʉ kwiiyenda varɨ vooveene, kweenda varɨ mpía, kʉva varɨ ˆviidʉ́ʉmbɨrɨraa, ˆvarɨ na ukudamu na <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">ˆvatʉ́kɨraa</char>, sɨ ˆvanyémyaa vavyɨɨrɨ vaavo, ˆvasiina dʉʉmbɨ, na sɨ varɨ kʉva vaaja tʉkʉ. <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Kʉva varɨ sɨ ˆveenda vaantʉ, sɨ ˆvasáakaa sáare jisire, ˆvalʉ́ʉsaa vaantʉ, sɨ ˆviiyɨ́mɨrɨraa, ˆvahʉʉmba na ˆvasʉʉla viintʉ viija. <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Kwiivalandʉka veende. Kʉva varɨ sɨ ˆviitwéetyaa. Kʉva varɨ ˆviiyónaa na ˆveenda ʉvɨ wa mʉvɨrɨ kʉlookya kʉmweenda Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Weerwii kʉndookiiyonekya veende ja vaantʉ ˆviíkalaa mwiikalo ˆutúubaa kɨra Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆasáakaa, maa kaa, siita veende ngururu jaachwe. Wiikerye na vaantʉ avo.<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Vamwɨ vaavo vamwaarɨ ˆvɨɨ́ngɨraa nyuumbii ja vaantʉ kwa ʉweere na vandoovasʉmʉla vaantʉ vaki vara ˆvarehera. Avo vaantʉ vaki vakwaatwa, varemeerwa nɨ ʉvɨ na vasúkwasukwaa nɨ ʉláku. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Vaantʉ vaki ava vasáakɨraa kʉtaanga viintʉ vifya, maa kaa, sɨ vadáhaa taanga ʉkoonko wa kɨkomi vii kaa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Vaantʉ ava vakɨ́ɨkanaa kɨra kɨmáárɨ, ja viintʉ mpɨɨndɨ jira Yáane na Yámbʉre ˆvayeráa kʉmʉkɨɨkana <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 7:11-22">Ufumo 7:11-22</ref>.</char></note> Mɨryʉʉngʉ yaavo yahopola na kuruma kwaavo kwasiitwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Maa kaa, sɨ varɨ fika kʉlɨ tʉkʉ, sa ʉkoókoyo waavo koonekana ʉrɨ kwa kɨra mʉʉntʉ, ja vira vya vala Yáane na Yámbʉre.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉlairiri wa Paúli kwa Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Maa kaa, weewe watuuba ʉvariyuli waanɨ, mwiikalo waanɨ, kɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆnasáakaa mbweeyye, kuruma kwaanɨ, kuyimirirya kwaanɨ, kweenda kwaanɨ vaantʉ, na kwiifafya kwaanɨ. <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Ʉmányire viintʉ vaantʉ ˆvaanturikirya na masáare ˆmeene nalʉmana noyo ʉko míijii ya Antiókia, Ikonío na Lísitra. Uturikiri ʉwo nuuyimirirya na <char style="w">Yéesu</char> Mweenevyoosi aandamurirya kufuma ayo yoosi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Kɨkomi, yoyoosi ˆarɨ saaka kwiikala ko mʉnyemya Mʉlʉʉngʉ ko va kɨɨntʉ kɨmwɨ na <char style="w">Kirisitʉ</char> Yéesu, turikiriwa arɨ. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Maa kaa, vaantʉ vavɨ na vakooveri tuuba varɨ kʉva vavɨ kʉnʉ voolongowa na voolongowerwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Baa neembe nɨ jeyyo, weewe utuube kʉyakwaata masáare yoosi ˆmeene ʉvariyʉrɨrwa ʉkayaruma kɨkomi. Sa ʉvamányire nɨ vala ani vakʉvariyʉrɨra masáare ayo yoosi ya kɨmáárɨ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Keende usinga waako, wavariyʉrɨrwa Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho. Aya yadáhaa kʉkʉheera tooti ya ʉlamuriri waako ko mwiilaangya Kirisitʉ Yéesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Masáare yoosi ˆYarɨ Mpeho yatɨɨte nkeeho ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Yabooha ko variyʉrɨra na ko kaanirya no temerera vaantʉ vareke ʉvɨ waavo, na ko wolola kwa ʉwoloki mwiikalo mbere ja Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Jeyyo, mʉʉntʉ wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ kiisikana arɨ na daha arɨ tʉmama kɨra mʉrɨmo mʉʉja.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ʉlairiri wa Paúli wo Herererya kwa Timotéeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Nɨ kʉlairirya niise mbere ja Mʉlʉʉngʉ na mbere ja <char style="w">Kirisitʉ</char> <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. Yeeye valamʉrɨra arɨ vaantʉ ˆvarɨ mooyo na ˆvaakwya mpɨɨndɨ jo kʉʉja kwaachwe na <char style="w" lemma="Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ">Ʉtemi</char> waachwe. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Variyʉla isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Ɨma neeja kʉbweeyya jeyyo mpɨɨndɨ joojo na sɨ ˆjiri joojo. Baamirirya, dalavya na vaheere mɨtɨma. Ivyo vyoosi vitʉmame ko yimirirya na kwa ʉvariyuli mʉʉja. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Sa kʉʉja jiri mpɨɨndɨ vaantʉ ˆvɨndoosiita ʉvariyuli wa kɨkomi. Voovo kiijɨɨngɨra veende vakiindya ˆvarɨ foo sa vadahe kukiimikirirya mpɨɨma jaavo na vadahe kʉvawyɨɨra kɨra ˆcheene chanyéeryaa matu yaavo. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Siita veende kʉteerera kɨmáárɨ na varindʉkɨra veende ʉteeri wa ʉloongo. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Maa kaa, weewe ʉndookiiyɨmɨrɨra kwa kɨra kɨɨntʉ. Yimirirya uturikiri, tʉmama mʉrɨmo wo variyʉla <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char>, na kɨkomi ukiimikirirye ʉtʉmami waako.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Nɨɨnɨ haaha toolwa niise ja <char style="w">mpóryo</char> ya kɨɨntʉ ˆkɨnywéewaa na mpɨɨndɨ jaanɨ jo suukya jafíkire.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 29:38-41">Ufumo 29:38-41</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Nalwíisiinʼye nkoondo ˆyabooha, nalʉ́marikiirye lʉyeendo lwaanɨ, nakʉláangiriirye kumwiilaangya kwaanɨ Kirisitʉ neeja. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Haaha niímiriiwe neeja itáaji ra ʉwoloki. Mweenevyoosi Mʉlamuli wa ʉwoloki kʉʉnjavɨka arɨ nɨɨnɨ sikʉ ɨra ya ʉlamuli wa vaantʉ voosi. Maa kaa, sɨ nɨɨnɨ vii tʉkʉ, baa na vara voosi ˆveene vawóojeraa kʉʉja kwaachwe na mpɨɨma.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Bweeyya chaangʉ wʉʉje na kwaanɨ. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Kɨrésike adoma na ɨsɨ ya Galatía, na Tíito adoma na ɨsɨ ya Dalumatía. Na so kweenda masáare ya weerʉ mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, Déema aandeka akadoma na múujii wa Tesaloníike. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Nɨ Lʉ́ka yeemweene noo ˆachaala na nɨɨnɨ aha. Mʉsaakɨre Maáriki wʉʉje ne. Yeeye abooha maatʉkʉ vii murimwii waanɨ. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Tíkiko namʉtʉma adome na múujii wa Eféeso.<verse eid="2TI 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆʉrɨ kʉʉja, nooloomba wʉʉndetere ɨra nkáancho ˆnareka kwa Kárpo ʉko múujii wa Turóoa na vira vitáabu vyaanɨ, na hasa vira vya ndɨrɨ. <figure style="fig" alt="The way a book was" file="hk00282c.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles - British and Foreign Bible Society" ref="4:13">Vitáabu vya ndɨrɨ</figure> <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alekɨsáanda mʉcháani, aambweeyyirya ʉvɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ. Mweenevyoosi mʉrɨha arɨ sa yara ˆmeene aambweeyyirya. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Baa weewe ʉmʉlaange neeja, sa yeeye ayasiita mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ masáare yiiswi.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Kati ˆnɨjáa niímiiwe balásii lwa ncholo, kusiina baa mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆaanyambirirya tʉkʉ. Voosi vajáa vaandeka. Nooloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ avoonere mbavariri sa isáare ɨrɨ. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Baa neembe nɨ jeyyo, Mweenevyoosi ajáa ɨɨma ivaru raanɨ na akaampeera ngururu sa ndʉʉse isáare raachwe ko kiimana na vaantʉ voosi sɨ ˆvarɨ <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char> varɨteere. Sa jeyyo, nɨɨnɨ nalamuririwa fuma mʉlomwii wa siimba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Mweenevyoosi kʉtʉlamurirya arɨ fuma kɨra ukiimiriri mʉvɨ na kʉʉnsʉmʉla arɨ ndɨrɨ nkaasʉ fʉʉrʉ Ʉtemii waachwe kurumwii. Yeeye abweeyyiriwe nkongojima kwa sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero. Kɨkomi.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lʉmbɨ yo Kiiteengʉla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Nuumbirya Akíila na Pirisíila muki waachwe, na nyuumba yoosi ya Onesifóoro. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erásto achaala múujii wa Koríinto. Kei Tirofíimo nɨjáa namʉreka kʉra múujii wa Miléeto, yeeye nɨ mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Konkomala ufike kʉnʉ mpɨɨndɨ ja mpeho sɨ jinaanda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ulúumbiiwe nɨ Eubúulo, Púude, Líini na Kɨlaáudi na ndʉʉ yoosi ya vaantʉ ˆvamwiiláangyaa Kirisitʉ. <verse eid="2TI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Mweenevyoosi ave hamwɨ na mʉtɨma waako. Mweenevyoosi avaheere nduwo nyuunyu voosi.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
